    "detailed_description": "<h1>New Mode + Leaderboard Out Now!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brand-new Survival Mode +  Leaderboard are now live!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new Season 1 of the <strong>Survival Mode</strong> has been added, with each season lasting 3 weeks. In this new mode, there are only 10 waves of battles. The 10th wave unlocks the survival challenge, which features unlimited battle time. However, monsters will gradually grow stronger over time, and bosses will spawn at regular intervals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supercats must rely on the weapons and items accumulated in the first 9 waves to strive for longer survival in the 10th wave's survival challenge. Their survival duration will be recorded in the leaderboard! Let's see who the strongest Supercat survivor is!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/08e300b2e0d87338862468f808828cd2.avif?t=1755494394\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/f1d7d99979fa18a7a62859c89e784bcf.avif?t=1755494394\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/1d9a5139767a095eaf241e41add53b07.avif?t=1755494394\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supercat Survivors is a cute cat-style Survivor-like game\u2014call your girlfriend to play and save Meow Star from crisis! You'll control a Supercat battling through 20 waves of enemies, or challenge the limit of survival time in <strong>Survival Mode</strong>. Upgrade and purchase weapons and items to empower your Supercat, preparing for the ultimate challenge of the unrelenting Endless Mode!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cute Style \u2013 Purrfect for Sharing with Your Girlfriend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who can resist sharing this adorable cat-themed game with their girlfriend? Tired of bloody battles and dark dungeons? Here lies a sanctuary of pure feline charm, waiting for you and your loved one to enjoy together, experience cozy cat moments, and lead your Supercats to defeat monsters and save Meow Star!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story \u2013 Crisis on Meow Star</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the spirit-energy-rich Meow Star, Supercat warriors guard the planet\u2019s lifeblood\u2014the Gemstone Ore\u2014while battling mutated plants for survival. These plants corrupt the land with invasive roots and devour energy with parasitic spores. The cats fight back with spirit-powered weapons, living tense yet peaceful lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly, chaos erupts! Alien beasts invade Meow Star, mutated plants go berserk, and the Supercats are caught in a pincer attack. A sinister alliance between the invaders and local mutants hides a secret buried deep in ancient ruins\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the conspiracy\u2014Meow is Justice! The fate of Meow Star hinges on one final battle!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/4adea9c6868519b7f7bad86f7da70ceb.poster.avif?t=1755494394\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/4adea9c6868519b7f7bad86f7da70ceb.webm?t=1755494394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/4adea9c6868519b7f7bad86f7da70ceb.mp4?t=1755494394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survivor-like \u2013 Pure Combat Thrills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow~ Each battle features 20 waves of enemies, lasting about a minute per wave. Control Supercats' movement\u2014their weapons auto-attack, transforming cute fluffballs into ruthless killers. Between waves, upgrade gear and push their power to the limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/898d98441279d5d0fbec477549ab7169.poster.avif?t=1755494394\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/898d98441279d5d0fbec477549ab7169.webm?t=1755494394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/898d98441279d5d0fbec477549ab7169.mp4?t=1755494394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike \u2013 Deep Build Synergy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow~ 20+ unique Supercats, 160+ items, and 20+ weapons offer endless Roguelike combinations. Each Supercat has strengths and weaknesses\u2014mastering synergies and growth paths is key! Experiment with strategies for surprising results!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/1e8d1b3a89685f871fdbb802b382c6af.poster.avif?t=1755494394\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/1e8d1b3a89685f871fdbb802b382c6af.webm?t=1755494394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/1e8d1b3a89685f871fdbb802b382c6af.mp4?t=1755494394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Modes \u2014 Endless &amp; Survival Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow~ As your Supercats grow stronger, so do the enemies. Clear 20 waves to unlock higher difficulties, as well as &quot;<strong>Endless Mode</strong>&quot; and &quot;<strong>Survival Mode</strong>&quot;\u2014true Supercats never surrender! The Supercats on the Survival Leaderboard are no ordinary ones. Come start an endless extreme adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lick your paws, unsheathe your claws, and face the infinite!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supercat Survivors is a cute cat-style Survivor-like game\u2014call your girlfriend to play and save Meow Star from crisis! You'll control a Supercat battling through 20 waves of enemies, or challenge the limit of survival time in <strong>Survival Mode</strong>. Upgrade and purchase weapons and items to empower your Supercat, preparing for the ultimate challenge of the unrelenting Endless Mode!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cute Style \u2013 Purrfect for Sharing with Your Girlfriend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who can resist sharing this adorable cat-themed game with their girlfriend? Tired of bloody battles and dark dungeons? Here lies a sanctuary of pure feline charm, waiting for you and your loved one to enjoy together, experience cozy cat moments, and lead your Supercats to defeat monsters and save Meow Star!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story \u2013 Crisis on Meow Star</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the spirit-energy-rich Meow Star, Supercat warriors guard the planet\u2019s lifeblood\u2014the Gemstone Ore\u2014while battling mutated plants for survival. These plants corrupt the land with invasive roots and devour energy with parasitic spores. The cats fight back with spirit-powered weapons, living tense yet peaceful lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly, chaos erupts! Alien beasts invade Meow Star, mutated plants go berserk, and the Supercats are caught in a pincer attack. A sinister alliance between the invaders and local mutants hides a secret buried deep in ancient ruins\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the conspiracy\u2014Meow is Justice! The fate of Meow Star hinges on one final battle!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/4adea9c6868519b7f7bad86f7da70ceb.poster.avif?t=1755494394\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/4adea9c6868519b7f7bad86f7da70ceb.webm?t=1755494394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/4adea9c6868519b7f7bad86f7da70ceb.mp4?t=1755494394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survivor-like \u2013 Pure Combat Thrills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow~ Each battle features 20 waves of enemies, lasting about a minute per wave. Control Supercats' movement\u2014their weapons auto-attack, transforming cute fluffballs into ruthless killers. Between waves, upgrade gear and push their power to the limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/898d98441279d5d0fbec477549ab7169.poster.avif?t=1755494394\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/898d98441279d5d0fbec477549ab7169.webm?t=1755494394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/898d98441279d5d0fbec477549ab7169.mp4?t=1755494394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike \u2013 Deep Build Synergy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow~ 20+ unique Supercats, 160+ items, and 20+ weapons offer endless Roguelike combinations. Each Supercat has strengths and weaknesses\u2014mastering synergies and growth paths is key! Experiment with strategies for surprising results!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/1e8d1b3a89685f871fdbb802b382c6af.poster.avif?t=1755494394\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/1e8d1b3a89685f871fdbb802b382c6af.webm?t=1755494394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415300/extras/1e8d1b3a89685f871fdbb802b382c6af.mp4?t=1755494394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Modes \u2014 Endless &amp; Survival Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow~ As your Supercats grow stronger, so do the enemies. Clear 20 waves to unlock higher difficulties, as well as &quot;<strong>Endless Mode</strong>&quot; and &quot;<strong>Survival Mode</strong>&quot;\u2014true Supercats never surrender! The Supercats on the Survival Leaderboard are no ordinary ones. Come start an endless extreme adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lick your paws, unsheathe your claws, and face the infinite!</p>",
